      "heading_path": [
        "14 CFR § 89.105 Remote identification requirement. (2025 edition)"
      ],
      "text": "Except as otherwise authorized by the Administrator or as provided in § 89.120, after September 16, 2023, no person may operate an unmanned aircraft within the airspace of the United States unless the operation meets the requirements of § 89.110 or § 89.115.",
